## 4. Role Cards

### Staff Roles

#### 1. Engagement Partner (`ENGAGEMENT_PARTNER`)
- **Summary & Titles:** Engagement Lead, Audit Partner, Signing Director.
- **Daily Responsibilities:** Engagement strategy, client relationship leadership, technical risk clearance, deliverable release, and final opinion sign-off.
- **What They Can Do:** Dual-Key engagement clearance; approve audit plans; clear significant risks; sign audit opinion reports; lock/archive engagements.
- **What They Cannot Do:** Cannot act as the Engagement Quality Reviewer (EQCR) on their own engagement; cannot bypass dual-key client acceptance.
- **Decisions Owned:** Final audit opinion, risk tolerance acceptance, issuance of audit deliverables.
- **Handoffs & Review:** Receives completed workpapers from Audit Manager; hands off to EQCR for independent review.
- **Allowed Scopes:** `ENGAGEMENT`, `CLIENT`, `FIRM_WIDE`.
- **Screens Reached:** Engagement Dashboard, Practice Overview, Risk & Strategy, Partner Sign-off, Financial Reports.
- **Access Termination:** Revoked or expired by Firm Administrator in Users & Access.

#### 2. Engagement Quality Reviewer (`QUALITY_REVIEWER`)
- **Summary & Titles:** EQCR Partner, Technical Reviewer, Concurring Reviewer.
- **Daily Responsibilities:** Independent objective evaluation of significant judgments, calculations, and reporting disclosures prior to report issuance (M2-02).
- **What They Can Do:** Review all engagement workpapers, audit plans, and partner risk memos; record formal EQCR concurring sign-off.
- **What They Cannot Do:** Cannot prepare workpapers; cannot direct fieldwork; cannot sign the primary audit report.
- **Decisions Owned:** Objective concurrence with the engagement team's conclusions.
- **Handoffs & Review:** Reviews work prepared by Manager and Partner; provides clearance back to Engagement Partner.
- **Allowed Scopes:** `ENGAGEMENT`.
- **Screens Reached:** Engagement File, Significant Judgments Review, EQCR Sign-Off Console.
- **Access Termination:** Revoked upon engagement archiving or by Administrator.

#### 3. Audit Manager (`AUDIT_MANAGER`)
- **Summary & Titles:** Audit Manager, Engagement Manager, Senior Manager.
- **Daily Responsibilities:** Fieldwork supervision, timeline tracking, audit plan execution, initial workpaper review, and review note management.
- **What They Can Do:** Allocate audit procedures; issue Provided-by-Client (PBC) requests; review and reject/approve fieldwork; sign off manager milestones.
- **What They Cannot Do:** Cannot execute final partner release; cannot grant system roles.
- **Decisions Owned:** Audit procedure completion, fieldwork readiness, review-point clearance.
- **Handoffs & Review:** Receives work from Senior/Staff Auditors; escalates unresolved findings to Engagement Partner.
- **Allowed Scopes:** `ENGAGEMENT`, `CLIENT`.
- **Screens Reached:** Workflow & Tasks, PBC Manager, Workpaper Review, Time & Budgets.
- **Access Termination:** Revoked by Administrator upon engagement completion.

#### 4. Senior Auditor (`SENIOR_AUDITOR`)
- **Summary & Titles:** Senior Auditor, Fieldwork In-Charge, Audit Senior.
- **Daily Responsibilities:** Execution of complex audit sections (e.g., revenue, financial instruments), initial staff review, and client fieldwork coordination.
- **What They Can Do:** Prepare complex workpapers; review junior auditor workpapers; draft PBC requests; reconcile Trial Balance (TB) and General Ledger (GL).
- **What They Cannot Do:** Cannot perform final sign-off; cannot close review points raised by Manager or Partner.
- **Decisions Owned:** Technical execution of assigned fieldwork sections.
- **Handoffs & Review:** Reviews Staff Auditor submissions; submits completed sections to Audit Manager.
- **Allowed Scopes:** `ENGAGEMENT`.
- **Screens Reached:** Audit Workpapers, Substantive Testing, PBC Tracker, Evidence Upload.
- **Access Termination:** Automated expiry on grant end-date or manual revocation.

#### 5. Staff Auditor (`STAFF_AUDITOR`)
- **Summary & Titles:** Staff Auditor, Junior Auditor, Audit Associate.
- **Daily Responsibilities:** Substantive testing, sample vouching, PBC reconciliation, and working paper preparation.
- **What They Can Do:** Create and edit assigned workpapers; verify uploaded PBC documents; log audit queries.
- **What They Cannot Do:** Cannot approve or review own workpapers (separation of duties); cannot close PBC items without senior sign-off.
- **Decisions Owned:** Accurate documentation of testing observations.
- **Handoffs & Review:** Hands off all work to Senior Auditor or Manager.
- **Allowed Scopes:** `ENGAGEMENT`.
- **Screens Reached:** My Tasks, Working Papers, PBC Request List, Evidence Viewer.
- **Access Termination:** Expiry date reached or Administrator revocation.

#### 6. Firm Administrator (`ADMINISTRATOR`)
- **Summary & Titles:** System Administrator, IT Systems Lead, Practice Operations Admin.
- **Daily Responsibilities:** Identity lifecycle management, roster binding, role assignment, and Microsoft Entra tenant connection oversight.
- **What They Can Do:** Search users, bind roster identities, grant/revoke roles and scopes, generate invitation links.
- **What They Cannot Do:** **Administrator access confers NO Partner authority.** Cannot view confidential audit findings, clear audit risks, or sign off deliverables.
- **Decisions Owned:** Identity verification and role-grant provisioning.
- **Handoffs & Review:** Provisions access upon authorized request from Managing Partner or HR.
- **Allowed Scopes:** `FIRM_WIDE`.
- **Screens Reached:** Users & Access, Roster Management, Directory Sync, Audit Log Viewer.
- **Access Termination:** Controlled by Firm Owner / Azure Entra Global Admin.

#### 7. Practice Finance Lead (`FIRM_FINANCE`)
- **Summary & Titles:** Finance Manager, Billing Coordinator, Practice Accountant.
- **Daily Responsibilities:** Engagement fee tracking, retainer/advance fee reconciliation, WIP analysis, and firm-wide invoicing.
- **What They Can Do:** Verify advance payments required for client activation; generate invoices; track project profitability.
- **What They Cannot Do:** Cannot modify audit working papers or sign off engagement phases.
- **Decisions Owned:** Commercial clearance and fee verification.
- **Handoffs & Review:** Confirms paid advance to trigger engagement activation alongside Dual-Key approvals.
- **Allowed Scopes:** `FIRM_WIDE`, `CLIENT`.
- **Screens Reached:** Firm Finance, Billing & Invoices, WIP & Retainers.
- **Access Termination:** Revoked by Administrator upon role change.

